00:02:42,552 --> 00:02:45,049
parameters in this generate response

67
00:02:45,049 --> 00:02:45,419
function.

68
00:02:46,574 --> 00:02:48,598
And the concrete values for these parameters

69
00:02:48,742 --> 00:02:49,738
